2-name: kanban-based-development
3-description: >
4-  Autonomous, parallel-safe development workflow using kanban-md.
5-  Use when the user asks to work through tasks, do kanban-based development,
6-  or when multiple agents need to coordinate work on the same codebase.
7:  Optimized for explicit handoffs and a "defer to user" protocol when
8:  human intervention is required.
9-allowed-tools:
