--
58-- **Worktree shell** at the task worktree for code changes
59-
60-Do not run multiple mutating `kanban-md` commands in parallel against the same board directory.
61-
62-If you are unsure you’re using the shared board, run `kanban-md board --compact` and confirm the board name/shape is what you expect.
63-
64:## Defer-to-User Boundary (exceptions)
65-
66-By default, agents should take tasks all the way to `done` (worktree → commit → merge → done).
67-
68:Defer to the user (leave the task in `review` with a handoff) only when you need:
69-
70-- an important product/spec decision with multiple valid options and no clear winner
71-- credentials/access or external actions (push to remote, releases, deployments, ENV variables, etc.)
72-- a merge conflict that requires judgment (not just mechanical resolution)
73:- repeated test/lint failures you can’t resolve
74-
