76-
77-Each agent session must generate a unique name to identify itself for claims. At the very start of a session, run:
78-
79-```bash
--
219-If you cannot continue without the user (decision, access, environment, or anything outside your control):
220-
221-From board home:
222-
223-```bash
224-kanban-md handoff <ID> --claim <agent> \
225:  --block "Waiting on user: <what you need>" \
226-  --note "## Handoff
227-- Current state:
