247-
248-```bash
249-kanban-md edit <ID> --claim <agent>
250:kanban-md edit <ID> --unblock --claim <agent>   # if it was blocked
251-kanban-md move <ID> in-progress --claim <agent>
252-```
253-
254-## Status meanings (keep the board honest)
255-
256-| Status | Meaning |
257-|---|---|
258-| `in-progress` | Actively being worked by an agent right now |
259:| `review` | Waiting state: ready to merge, or waiting on user/decision/unblock |
260-| `done` | Merged to main (and checks pass) |
261-
