+- An all-author check finds 35 notes linked to absent 18932/26058: the 12 customer-authored rows plus 23 rows authored by 0 or administrator 1.
+- Exact per-user note IDs, logins, emails, roles, targets, reproduction, and the 12/35 overlap are in issues/SLT-SETUP-99B-unallowlisted-subscription-notes.md.
+
+This is an allowlist failure even if the notes are probably SLT-generated. Task 119 does not enumerate the note artifact class, and its step 5 requires deletion of only allowlisted IDs one at a time. Inferring permission from a prefix, user owner, or potential subscription cascade would violate the task and the user's explicit teardown rule.
